  <h3>Cookies and Identifiers</h3>
  <p>Cookies are files with a small amount of data that are commonly used as anonymous unique identifiers. The app
      does not use cookies explicitly. However, the third-party software in the app uses similar technologies,
      such as your device's advertising identifier and an app instance ID, as described in this policy. See
      “Advertising and Tracking Choices” above for how to control these.</p>

  <h3>Security</h3>
  <p> We value your trust in providing us your Personal Information, thus we are striving
